{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b74ae422626b1e8aedf70d75e1d69d44da6cab34a672a9ee278433ec1a515955","ja":"『フレッシュクリエイト』第3回目の打ち合わせ","zh":"“Fresh Create”第3次碰头会","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"68bf08dd5a02a2f27478be8ef77b6b789436ab79c1bb677b04eecac3fe08f13b","ja":"今回の企画は『5人でリレー小説を書いてみよう』！\n書く順番は、さっき引いたくじで決まります。","zh":"这次的企划是“5人接力写小说”！\n写作顺序由刚才抽取的签来决定。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d75e543a28cabb1f8e3c77a1a5c3fdfeab961323b0b77794f447a49af36206e4","ja":"じゃあ、さっそく開いてみましょう！\nえーっと……あ、私は3番目です。","zh":"那么，马上打开看看吧！\n呃……啊，我是第3个。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"728b8879b88695a37aacd89f51cda8708d60d2c857240aa7c6278610c7b1d9fa","ja":"えーっ！？　アタシがトップバッター！？\nリレー小説って、始めがすっごく重要だよね……。","zh":"诶——！？由我打头阵！？\n接力小说的话，开头可是超级重要的吧……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"a9997aef44b3bda7d532d0dc93478525fd595a50afa4dde0c4512f206d064651","ja":"そうだと思いますけど、\nみんなで協力する企画ですから！","zh":"我觉得是这样没错，\n但这毕竟是大家齐心协力的企划嘛！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"8f578fd822d8208176af8673f5b52567219ec17b7d2b406b4c645dbb99235a8c","ja":"続きを盛り上げられるように、\n私も頑張りますね！","zh":"为了能让接下来的内容更加热闹，\n我也会加油的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b1990f12d71f13cbc0943b0fc58ecb026fed56b20bc14290a260fcc5e46d8f51","ja":"ありがと～、紗代子～！\nうん、やるからには気合入れて書かないとね！","zh":"谢谢～，纱代子～！\n嗯，既然要做，就得打起干劲来写呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"a386a33e96152dd69f5de26ebfa5898f00f3c227497abb5a8c01ce8c32ae8772","ja":"はい！　アイドルちゃんたちと紡ぐドキドキリレー小説\n2番目のありさも全力でいきますよ！","zh":"好！和偶像们共同编织的心跳接力小说\n第2棒的亚利沙也会全力以赴的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"4c057b0cf4d930cde43791a63d3f18f679658a5370f37bb4c97c2e36bc183a58","ja":"自由に書いていいんですもんね。\nこうなったらありさの趣味全開に……ムフフ……♪","zh":"可以自由书写对吧。\n既然这样，亚利沙就要彻底展现个人爱好了……嘿嘿嘿……♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"be13a98a6638a391cbf6cdf47a961c3c84848b2293f00ced6852fc7f220ce0c9","ja":"はいは～い！　4番目は私でーす！\nどんな内容にしようかな～♪","zh":"到～！　第4个是我～！\n该发点什么内容好呢～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"445701ba5ed432e69bc263828d6906971f060ce559ee23d5e741d4b579bdcc90","ja":"あれ？　千早ちゃん、どうしたの？\nもしかして……6番目だったとか！？","zh":"哎？千早，怎么了吗？\n难道说……是第6个！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"8471ed716227de6a2cccaccdfcc61c111848a8bec361599e60fcffbc9e56cc88","ja":"それなら、5番目は誰になるんだろう……。\n確かに困っちゃうよね？","zh":"那样的话，第5个会是谁呢……\n确实很让人为难吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"019b4b5ea9bc1e985fa0c43b0cf5ac90ea7183dc281080b0f79dc2de7835aaa5","ja":"あ、いえ、私は5番目で……。\nその……私が最後でいいのかと……。","zh":"啊，不，我是第5个……\n那个……我在想，让我来压轴真的好吗……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"eac0adc04751ebd27cac089a570a29a2844c26a566962ede8cd1da6881e8f82c","ja":"わあっ、そうだったんだ！　もっちろん大丈夫だよ！\nリレー小説、楽しもうね千早ちゃん♪","zh":"哇，原来是这样啊！当然没问题啦！\n接力小说，要好好享受哦，千早♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1029.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"d1942112da22be64caa9dcafd2bc8cbdae6f5fc911e804c316d5260d35afe46b","ja":"は、はい。よろしくお願いします……。","zh":"好、好的。请多关照……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:45:10+00:00"}
